  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Do they ever say \"までは\"?\nAs in,\n\"３時までは、来ないでください。\"　for \"Please don't come until 3.\"\n\nOr would simple \"３時まで\" suffice?\nThank you.",
      "html": "Do they ever say \"までは\"?<br/>As in,<br/>\"３時までは、来ないでください。\"　for \"Please don't come until 3.\"<br/><br/>Or would simple \"３時まで\" suffice?<br/>Thank you.",
      "credits_raw": "sevaa",
      "content_sha256": "54eb2db1f03d145c71cf7c0f39e75856473eb562c7e3a973bf22385fafbc9a4d",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "3時まで is sufficient.\n3時までは is used to emphasis. Please don't dare come to the meeting room until 3 as we are having an interview.",
      "html": "3時まで is sufficient.<br/>3時までは is used to emphasis. Please don't dare come to the meeting room until 3 as we are having an interview.",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "d84c32d656dc0e719706788442adf799a73840252d222f485cd534b3b3bbc2f0",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "The 'to' indicated by made can be time like (40 days) space like (Kyushu) or more metaphorical ([lit: up to raining])",
      "html": "The 'to' indicated by made can be time like (40 days) space like (Kyushu) or more metaphorical ([lit: up to raining])",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "849fc4b58ebe08054b1e622abfc44f352f31d76931c359361f7445ed72d7bd7c",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Note there is some difference between までに and まで. \nまで : \"I stayed up till 10pm\" \n１０時まで起きてた。\n[You actually went to bed at 10pm]\nまでに : \"I had to get back by 10pm\" \n１０時までに帰らなくっちゃ\n[You could come back earlier, but not later]\n(Hmm, hope that last example is OK)",
      "html": "Note there is some difference between までに and まで. <br/>まで : \"I stayed up till 10pm\" <br/>１０時まで起きてた。<br/>[You actually went to bed at 10pm]<br/>までに : \"I had to get back by 10pm\" <br/>１０時までに帰らなくっちゃ<br/>[You could come back earlier, but not later]<br/>(Hmm, hope that last example is OK)",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "efd3cad8e675e8c26de185f65c968e4390d53a592e91ee8259998fb1bfa462b5",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "It's natural! ↑:)",
      "html": "It's natural! ↑:)",
      "credits_raw": "your name",
      "content_sha256": "1adc0ee5ed1ae1514de6dd1cde59ba229be01870b2262e4129d993ec146ad793",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "The 1st example ４０日間 is more natural.",
      "html": "The 1st example ４０日間 is more natural.",
      "credits_raw": "your name",
      "content_sha256": "349b47904e1847cbabb4381790cf223c7fa485c10d32f87e91e908105f70e6e6",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
